   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Elijah stood before King Ahab, said no dew and no rain",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the ravens brought him bread and meat, morning and evening again",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Down in Zarephath a widow had one handful of flour",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Down in Zarephath a widow had one handful of flour",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the jar did not run out and the oil kept pouring every hour",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "How long will you keep limping between two opinions, he said",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 1.14,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Four hundred fifty prophets danced and shouted till the day was dead",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 1.46,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He soaked the wood three times with water, filled the trench up to the brim",
   "heard": 15,
   "words": 15,
   "error_s": 1.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the fire of the LORD came down and licked it up for him",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 4.15,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD, he is God",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 6.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD, he is God",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 9.79,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Fire fell on Carmel and the people cried",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 10.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD, he is God",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 8.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Then he ran from Jezebel and lay down underneath a broom bush",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 11.43,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Said, Enough, LORD, take my life; I am no better than my fathers",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 7.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But an angel touched him, get up and eat, a loaf on burning stones",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 7.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Forty days and forty nights he walked to Horeb all alone",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 14.05,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
